n\ud83c\udfb3 GAMEPLAY\nStep into a stunning VR bowling alley and experience the thrill of the perfect strike. Use intuitive hand-tracking controls to pick up, aim, and roll your ball with precision. Feel the satisfying impact as pins scatter across the lane!\n\n\ud83c\udfc6 FEATURES\n\u2022 10 Unique Levels - Progress through increasingly challenging stages\n\u2022 Star Rating System - Earn 1-3 stars based on your performance\n\u2022 Level Unlock - Master each level to unlock the next challenge\n\u2022 Ball Skins - Customize your ball with unlockable designs\n\u2022 Power-ups - Grab Multi-Ball, Explosive, and Slow-Time boosts\n\u2022 Global Leaderboard - Compete with players worldwide\n\u2022 Stats Tracking - Monitor your progress and high scores\n\u2022 Immersive Sound Effects - Realistic bowling sounds\n\n\ud83c\udfae CONTROLS\nDesigned for Meta Quest hand-tracking. Simply reach out, grab the ball, and throw naturally!\n\n\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 FOR EVERYONE\nEasy to learn, challenging to master. Perfect for VR beginners and bowling enthusiasts alike.\n\nDownload now and become the Ball Blitz champion!", "short_description": "Roll, aim, and knock down pins in this immersive VR bowling adventure! Master 10 challenging levels, unlock stylish ball skins, grab powerful power-ups, and climb the global leaderboard. With intuitive hand-tracking controls and stunning visuals, Ball Blitz VR delivers arcade fun in virtual reality. Perfect for players of all skill levels!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ball-blitz-vr.pages.dev/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NVR Labs", "support_website_url": "https://ball-blitz-vr.pages.dev/support.html", "website_url": "https://ball-blitz-vr.pages.dev/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_t